@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+# Activities
+
+Activities represent events and timeline actions across account boards.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities.json`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activities the current user can access, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator user ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+    "action": "card_published",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.540Z",
+    "description": "David added \"First!\"",
+    "particulars": {},
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {},
+    "board": {},
+    "creator": {}
+  }
+]
+```
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
